# PP-<number>: short summary (≤72 chars, imperative, no full stop)
#
#   PP-42: add wastewater dashboard endpoint
#   no-issue: a trivial change without an issue (docs, formatting, config)
#
# A blank line, then an optional description of "why" (not "how").
#
# The commit check only runs on PRs into `main` (dev is free).
